L000351		\caption{$\ell_{A_iA_j}$ (blue) and its value for thermal 2-uniform state   given by \cref{Ltherm2uni} (red) are plotted with increasing $\alpha$ for multi-copy SYK model each involving 5-parties.}
L000352		\label{finitetemp}
